<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40344" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rādīcĭtus</span></b> , adv.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>with the roots</i>, <i>by the roots</i>
			(class.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">effodere herbas malas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cato, R. R. 50</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">concidere rosetum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 1, 35, 1</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Cat. 64, 288</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">evellere arborem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Suet. Vesp. 5</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">eximere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					4, 33, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">interire,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 6,
					3, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">auferre ungues,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Prop. 3,
					7</span></i>
			 (4, 6), 51 al. — </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>by the roots</i>, i.
			e. <i>utterly</i>, <i>completely</i>,
				<i>radically</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">radicitus tollere atque extrahere cupiditatem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Fin. 2, 9, 27</span></i>
			; cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">extrahere religionem ex animis hominum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					N. D. 1, 43, 121</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">excutere opinionem alicui,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Tusc. 1, 46, 111</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">omnia malefacta vostra repperi radicitus,</span>”
				<i>thoroughly</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Most. 5, 1, 62</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
